## Provenance of the underlying translations

This repository packages 17 Bible translations (9 English, 8 Portuguese;
see the Translations tables in README.md for the full list of names and
abbreviations). The underlying translation texts themselves are not
authored by NEUU. README.md's License section states that all included
translations are in the public domain or distributed under open licenses
(e.g. the King James Version and other historical English translations
used here are in the public domain).

This repository does not track, per translation, the specific original
source (download URL, upstream repository, or publisher) each text file
was sourced from, nor a per-translation breakdown of license terms beyond
the "public domain or open license" statement above. Anyone requiring
translation-specific provenance or license confirmation for redistribution
purposes should verify it independently against the original publisher of
that translation before relying on it. If you have this information and
can contribute it, a pull request improving this NOTICE is welcome.
